x21450 text "A0's check and run emits C and compiles it with clang, which is why it is slower than its check alone. Timings are wall-clock under a heavy machine load (1-minute load average up to 298 on 8 cores), so absolute values will move on a quiet machine; the order is what to read. Shown first: A0 and the best-known languages; all 49 are behind the disclosure, in the same order. results/lang-axes.json."
